    {
      "id": "F05",
      "classification": "necessary",
      "status": "open",
      "title": "正式選模與CPU預約的轉接來源未完整凍結",
      "locations": [
        "scripts/omni_revision/formal_local.py:43",
        "scripts/omni_revision/cpu_execution.py:43",
        "scripts/omni_revision/core_selection.py:10",
        "scripts/omni_revision/legacy.py:5"
      ],
      "finding": "core_selection實際使用reliability.py的T/tau規則；metrics雖記其SHA，checked_job未核measurement_sources_sha256，cpu checked_sources的20 execution+8 implementation+3 frozen集合也漏它。CPU reserve另實際import scripts/selftrained/finance.py，這個預算驗證來源同樣未綁入新入口的稽核與來源集合。",
      "counterexample": "在隔離副本只把reliability溫度網格改為(1.75,)，啟動全新process，實際checked_sources仍通過，實際select_temperature回1.75；metrics保留原33點網格及原SHA。只有唯讀git HEAD/show用明示private fixture，未建立commit或改任何遠端。",
      "evidence": "current-source-closure-result.json",
      "required_resolution": "正式門檻須驗證實際執行的measurement／核心傳遞依賴與凍結SHA，並把需獨立審核的預約轉接來源納入可強制的review/source集合；新process中只改reliability或其他必要依賴應在reserve／train／select前拒絕。"
    },
    {
      "id": "F06",
      "classification": "necessary",
      "status": "open",
      "title": "六A跨job同分決選漏掉較早checkpoint",
      "locations": [
        "scripts/omni_revision/core_selection.py:86",
        "docs/omni-products/v1/formal-recipes.json:candidate_selection.AV"
      ],
      "finding": "配方明定dev paired、missing-cue、較早checkpoint、job_order依序決選，實作僅用best.dev_score及job_order。單job已保留較早checkpoint，跨六job仍會選錯。",
      "counterexample": "六份明示合成best紀錄皆dev_score=.5；av-additive-s11 best update1000，av-time-rope-s29 best update500。實際select_models選前者，違反凍結的較早checkpoint優先。formal_result、model與calibration回應為private fixtures，沒有正式訓練或final模型預測。",
      "evidence": "current-gate-selection-result.json",
      "required_resolution": "按凍結順序在相同dev成績時先比較best.update，再用job_order；並保持原六A訓練設定不變。"
    },
    {
      "id": "F07",
      "classification": "necessary",
      "status": "open",
      "title": "子程序建立回應中斷可誤報停止",
      "locations": [
        "scripts/omni_revision/cpu_execution.py:148",
        "scripts/omni_revision/cpu_execution.py:151",
        "scripts/omni_revision/cpu_execution.py:160",
        "scripts/omni_revision/cpu_execution.py:364"
      ],
      "finding": "all_training_processes_exited在Popen回傳後才改False，try/finally更晚。若OS已建立child而取消發生在回應記錄前，外層可捕捉中斷卻保留原True，進而把未知child當已停止。",
      "counterexample": "Popen fault fixture真建立一個sleep子程序後於回傳邊界注入KeyboardInterrupt；實際bounded_child返回時child仍活著，旗標True。把同旗標交實際finish_cpu（GitHub及ledger均明示fixtures）會得到failed-stopped。審閱者隨即kill+wait，已真確認此私有fixture child退出。",
      "evidence": "current-cpu-boundaries-result.json",
      "required_resolution": "進入任何child建立邊界前先持久／內存保守標示未知，已取得handle則停止並wait；未知start或wait狀態不得變成verified stopped/failed-stopped。要以同反例回核，不只測已取得Popen物件後的deadline。"
    }
  ],
